{"version":1,"content":"<p>據The Information報道，Meta計劃將旗下新款人工智能設備Muse Charm的售價定為300美元（約合人民幣2100元）。這款配備屏幕的小型設備允許用户直接與AI智能體對話，並可能附贈Verizon提供的12個月免費5G數據套餐。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587190.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:03:58.644509+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T05:38:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T05:57:18.137144+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T05:57:18.137144+00:00","content_hash":"af958c56b8416215e2f7bc5802687e7e0a284b31de3fefdcbe36669e5c2f1a00","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}